{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We don't make games, just link new worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess War</strong> is turn-based strategy 1 vs 1 PVP shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play with your friend for invitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/eb6cf44150c9fa90542717f4caf6df8c.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/eb6cf44150c9fa90542717f4caf6df8c.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When game started, each player be assigned to\u00a0red team or blue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various characters. Each character has different status (health, damage, ...) and unique skills. So you need to choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldier : Have the ability to kill enemies based on your high stemina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor : Can heal allies, but cannot attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpenter : Build walls to impede movement for enemy and to defend\u00a0allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you choose character, place them strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has different spawn area. and\u00a0you can spawn 5 characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/adab183731fa1a259822d5e002e8eadb.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/adab183731fa1a259822d5e002e8eadb.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can spend turn points on each turn to take an action (move, attack, build etc).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Character unique skill needs more turn points. So if you want to move and use skills at once, calculate your turn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All turn points for turn player spent, then move on to the next turn.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/2beeb29f7baec82320d21cfcf9a2e32c.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/2beeb29f7baec82320d21cfcf9a2e32c.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each turn, buff areas will be spawned at certain area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff area will give positive effect for player who enter the area. so defending the various terrains and buff areas could be great strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/1da1fe448041b195f9f7bb150c1334b7.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/1da1fe448041b195f9f7bb150c1334b7.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all of your opponent's characters to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>We hope you enjoy. thanks.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665650?t=1753606084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/127f7bc6463c748693e43c63499e307526238160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753606084","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/519f2019db0383eea683ad7af2758b5a21ef47f7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753606084","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/519f2019db0383eea683ad7af2758b5a21ef47f7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753606084","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We don't make games, just link new worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess War</strong> is turn-based strategy 1 vs 1 PVP shooter game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also play with your friend for invitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/eb6cf44150c9fa90542717f4caf6df8c.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/eb6cf44150c9fa90542717f4caf6df8c.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When game started, each player be assigned to\u00a0red team or blue team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various characters. Each character has different status (health, damage, ...) and unique skills. So you need to choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldier : Have the ability to kill enemies based on your high stemina.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doctor : Can heal allies, but cannot attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carpenter : Build walls to impede movement for enemy and to defend\u00a0allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After you choose character, place them strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has different spawn area. and\u00a0you can spawn 5 characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/adab183731fa1a259822d5e002e8eadb.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/adab183731fa1a259822d5e002e8eadb.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can spend turn points on each turn to take an action (move, attack, build etc).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Character unique skill needs more turn points. So if you want to move and use skills at once, calculate your turn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All turn points for turn player spent, then move on to the next turn.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/2beeb29f7baec82320d21cfcf9a2e32c.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/2beeb29f7baec82320d21cfcf9a2e32c.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each turn, buff areas will be spawned at certain area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buff area will give positive effect for player who enter the area. so defending the various terrains and buff areas could be great strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras/1da1fe448041b195f9f7bb150c1334b7.avif?t=1753606084\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/extras_big/1da1fe448041b195f9f7bb150c1334b7.avif?t=1753606084 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate all of your opponent's characters to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>We hope you enjoy. thanks.</p>","developers":["LINK"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665650/9bf981ed453f62ca397d4fdd78df156f4a4b16f8/header.jpg?t=1753606084","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665650/1886828174/073281b83f835cb8d3cd054f70069998ffa055b7/1750419157/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751340809","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665650/1886828174/073281b83f835cb8d3cd054f70069998ffa055b7/1750419157/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751340809","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3665650/1886828174/073281b83f835cb8d3cd054f70069998ffa055b7/1750419157/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751340809","id":257127956,"name":"Welcome to Possess War !","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257127956/46b9b956c39dd824c847052c3882e56885686c2a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751340809"}],"name":"Possess War","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Possess War - $0.99 USD","packageid":1291411,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Possess War"}],"packages":[1291411],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Proc